  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat. Cook ginger paste, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Drain and rinse rice.\n• Add the water and a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil.\n• Add white rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat. Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10-15 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a9b5cd1960f8a32f0bf963-9abc82d1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks. Finely chop garlic. Trim and halve green beans. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Cut broccoli(including the stalk!) into small florets.\n• When rice has 10 minutes remaining, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook green beans, broccoli and carrot, tossing regularly, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add half the garlic and cook, until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a bowl. Season and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a9b5cd1960f8a32f0bf963-e9bb73cd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook tofu, tossing, in batches, until browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add sweet chilli sauce, the soy sauce and remaining garlic, tossing, until combined, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a9b5cd1960f8a32f0bf963-cadb755e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide ginger rice between bowls.\n• Top with garlicky greens and sweet chilli tofu.\n• Garnish with crispy shallots.\n• Serve with a dollop of mayonnaise. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a9b5cd1960f8a32f0bf963-fa9c464d.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
